        "TileImage": "$($repository ba02f271-f256-41d7-97cc-c0a36e5db1e7).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\rWelcome to Bangkok.\r\rWithin the walls of the Himmapan Hotel, a group of skilled pickpockets have taken up residence.\rTheir misdeeds could have been dealt with in the normal way, but last month a man was found dead in the bathroom.\rThe whole thing was closed as an accident, but according to our findings, it appears it was murder. Probably caught one of the pickpockets in the act.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
